{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 170,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This fall, physicists in Italy published results\nsuggesting that neutrinos travel faster than"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4230,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "light - significantly faster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6140,
    "dDurationMs": 4419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If true, this is really big news in physics,\nand of course most scientists are greeting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10559,
    "dDurationMs": 1431,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the results with skepticism…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11990,
    "dDurationMs": 1180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why, you might ask?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13170,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, they fly in the face of the well-established\nand experimentally supported theories of special"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17770,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and general relativity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19440,
    "dDurationMs": 3350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And extraordinary claims require extraordinary\nproof."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22790,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's go visit the OPERA experiment in\nItaly and try to catch some neutrinos!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26680,
    "dDurationMs": 4210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The kind researchers looking for the Higgs\nBoson at the LHC in Switzerland are already"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30890,
    "dDurationMs": 4079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "crashing protons into each other to create\nexplosions of subatomic particles – and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34969,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "luckily some of those particles are neutrinos\nwhich fly straight through the earth's crust"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39049,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to us here in Italy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40929,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are just three things that we have to\ndo:"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42879,
    "dDurationMs": 3991,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "1) We have to catch the neutrinos, which,\ngiven that neutrinos will travel for roughly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46870,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2 years through lead before stopping, is an\nambitious task."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49890,
    "dDurationMs": 1569,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But we can do it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51459,
    "dDurationMs": 4840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "2) Once we have a neutrino, we have to figure\nout which proton collision it came from: imagine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56299,
    "dDurationMs": 3970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "blowing up a case of wine bottles, at night,\nand then having your neighbor call you up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60269,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and say \"I caught a piece of glass!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62499,
    "dDurationMs": 1671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you tell me which one it is?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64170,
    "dDurationMs": 1061,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, we're that neighbor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 65231,
    "dDurationMs": 5049,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And 3) Once we figure out which collision\na neutrino came from, we have to know exactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70280,
    "dDurationMs": 4610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what time the collision happened, AND exactly\nwhen we caught the corresponding neutrino."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74890,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And because the scientists in Switzerland\nare hundreds of kilometers away, we have to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78390,
    "dDurationMs": 3829,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "use timing signals from GPS satellites in\norder to synchronize our clocks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82219,
    "dDurationMs": 3911,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we're off by even a microsecond, we'll\nget the speed wrong by a million km/hr."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86130,
    "dDurationMs": 1589,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that's it!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87719,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now that we've measured the neutrinos going\nfaster than light, what next?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90859,
    "dDurationMs": 4291,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, because our results are so groundbreaking\nand our observations so hard to make, the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95150,
    "dDurationMs": 3509,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "scientific community wants to be absolutely\nsure we didn't make any big mistake - so we"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98659,
    "dDurationMs": 4031,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have to wait for other experiments around\nthe world to confirm or refute our claim."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102690,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this could take months or even years,\nso be patient…"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105720,
    "dDurationMs": 3149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in the meanwhile, why not learn more about\nneutrinos?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 108869,
    "dDurationMs": 1221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or how GPS works?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110090,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(click below to make a choice)"
    } ]
  } ]
}
